  "description": "Keyset (cursor) pagination for .NET that stays fast on page 10,000, because OFFSET is a table scan. This framework-free core carries Page<T>, the opaque cursor codec, and the keyset predicate builder — all reflection-free and AOT-clean. Add OrionPage.EntityFrameworkCore for the ToKeysetPageAsync query extension.",
